    "description": "<p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p><i>An explosive detonates when triggered by a timer.</i> </p><h2><span id=\"Detonite_Statistics_.28CL_2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Detonite_Statistics_(CL_2)\">Detonite Statistics (CL 2)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Area, Artificial, Energy </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> The explosive's timer expires; targeting all creatures, Droids, and objects in a 1-Square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +10 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> None. </p><p><b>Suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>:</b>&nbsp;The following are suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>&nbsp;for this Hazard: </p><ul>\n <li><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> (DC 14):</b> The character disarms the Detonite.</li>\n</ul><h2><span id=\"Explosive_Charge_Statistics_.28CL_5.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Explosive_Charge_Statistics_(CL_5)\">Explosive Charge Statistics (CL 5)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Area, Artificial, Energy </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> The explosive's timer expires; targeting all creatures, Droids, and objects in a 1-Square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +10 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> None. </p><p><b>Suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>:</b>&nbsp;The following are suggested&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>&nbsp;for this Hazard: </p><ul>\n <li><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> (DC 16):</b> The character disarms the Explosive Charge.</li>\n</ul>",
